            "notes": "I have some things starred as the ***Must-Buys***, with the other items around it being based on what you can afford, and some good choices placed in the \"Optional Items\" section.\n\n[T.Racer](item_996e13d5-9521-4312-944f-d672f528776b) I put a bunch of analysis about why I like this above, in case you skipped over it.\n\n[Ammo Reserves](item_982d53aa-5ef4-493f-93e7-9e374d0ebf34) is tracer's best green item for damage as her fire rate is so fast. For other heroes who aren't constantly clip dumping, compensator makes more sense, but for Tracer, numbers wise, it isn't close.\n- Regular clip: 240\n- Clip+[Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0): 253\n- Clip+[Ammo Reserves](item_982d53aa-5ef4-493f-93e7-9e374d0ebf34): 288\n\n[Charged Plating](item_b8ca58e7-6ae2-40ee-8618-fe2f32315295) is really good as it is an unnerfed 25 armor+8 health, and you get ult super fast so you will spend most of the round with that armor.\n\n[Ballistic Buffer](item_40146dd3-a8cb-40ca-8917-c430bfa2be0e) has also been good in my experience, since even 1 damage will proc that 50 overhealth, and your trades become very favored whenever its up.",
