            "created_at": "2025-09-29T00:22:04.612308+00:00",
            "notes": "[Phantasmic Flux](item_5e644a79-cf6e-4196-8d0a-232f75004643) Boosts our survivability a lot, and our damage is already good, so this doesn't hurt us a lot in that stat. We can deal a lot of damage without taking too much poke, which lets us build up overhealth over the course of a fight very easily.\n\nI haven't tested it enough, but I feel like taking another weapon lifesteal item like [Plasma Converter](item_25869f9a-9a29-4e19-96b6-9d8a28c59318) at times might be really good, since it helps a lot with [Phantasmic Flux](item_5e644a79-cf6e-4196-8d0a-232f75004643).\n\nDamage to reach 100 overhealth per weapon lifesteal.\n- 15% lifesteal = 667\n- 25% lifesteal = 400\n- 35% lifesteal = 286\n\n\nAnd in the chance we do die even while being survivable, we have a whole second life to win the fight with with [Auto Recall](item_ae3dbebf-c306-4408-b698-6f666ace0a7c).\n\nBesides this, just buy whatever weapon items make sense to you, and know that ammo is an excellent stat.",
