            "notes": "At this point we have everything we need. We have ammo, weapon power, and survivability, so now we just go for whatever weapon power items are good and make sense. These last two rounds are pretty freeform. If you skipped around, I talk about the main weapon items I think are good in ***Round 5***.\n\nAlso generally, swapping out [Pulse Detector](item_79ddef46-8917-4d8f-a123-7ddb589ad3e7) for [The Closer](item_173c6d0f-dbe6-440e-924f-0ce08189ddce) is great, since we only need the revealing effect from one item, and post [Quantum Clip](item_3a108115-ec6e-4b98-8074-1b015cf535f1)+[Stockpile](item_a113eb56-9999-4f22-9bd7-18f4dbd00cc2), your ammo should be enough.\n\nIf you take a peek at ***Round 7***, I talk about items a bit too, so you can make a decision about your round 6 buys from the info there.",
